      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Final Image Upscaler (Post-FLUX.2 / Post-Qwen-Image-Edit)\n\nUse this **ONLY after** your final `16:9` scene is merged in FLUX.2 or Qwen-Image-Edit \u2014 and only when you actually need a higher-resolution still.\n\n## When do you actually need this?\n- **Pika H3 Flex / MiniMax H3 / Wan 2.2 / HunyuanVideo 1.5 / LTX DFR:** Usually **NOT needed** \u2014 a `1344\u00d7768` merged still already matches or exceeds native resolution.\n- **LTX-2.5 2-stage Full HD (`1920\u00d71088`):** Turn **`FIT TO TARGET SIZE?` = ON** (`1920\u00d71088`) for crisp faces/eyes in Stage 2.\n- **High-res standalone photo/still (no video):** Turn **`USE UPSCALE MODEL?` = ON** and **`FIT TO TARGET SIZE?` = OFF** to keep raw 2\u00d7/4\u00d7 model resolution.\n- **Never feed 4K into Video I2V** \u2014 video models downscale it anyway; upscale the rendered *video* instead.\n\n## Two 1-Click Switches\n1. **`USE UPSCALE MODEL?`**\n   - **ON (default):** Uses `UpscaleModelLoader` + `ImageUpscaleWithModel` (best sharpness/detail; drop e.g. `4x-UltraSharp.pth` or `RealESRGAN_x4plus.pth` into `ComfyUI/models/upscale_models/`).\n   - **OFF (No Model):** Fast `lanczos` resize directly to `Target WIDTH \u00d7 Target HEIGHT` \u2014 **if you have no files in `models/upscale_models/`, press Ctrl+B on `UpscaleModelLoader` and `ImageUpscaleWithModel` so ComfyUI skips validating the loader.**\n2. **`FIT TO TARGET SIZE?`**\n   - **ON (default):** Cleanly resizes the model output down (`area`) to exact `1920\u00d71088` (supersampled 1080p, \u00f732 video-ready).\n   - **OFF:** Outputs the full raw model upscale size (e.g., 4\u00d7).\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Final Image Upscaler (Post-FLUX.2 / Post-Qwen-Image-Edit)\n\nUse this **ONLY after** your final `16:9` scene is merged in FLUX.2 or Qwen-Image-Edit \u2014 and only when you actually need a higher-resolution still.\n\n## When do you actually need this?\n- **Pika H3 Flex / MiniMax H3 / Wan 2.2 / HunyuanVideo 1.5 / LTX DFR:** Usually **NOT needed** \u2014 a `1344\u00d7768` merged still already matches or exceeds native resolution.\n- **LTX-2.5 2-stage Full HD (`1920\u00d71088`):** Turn **`FIT TO TARGET SIZE?` = ON** (`1920\u00d71088`) for crisp faces/eyes in Stage 2.\n- **High-res standalone photo/still (no video):** Turn **`USE UPSCALE MODEL?` = ON** and **`FIT TO TARGET SIZE?` = OFF** to keep raw 2\u00d7/4\u00d7 model resolution.\n- **Never feed 4K into Video I2V** \u2014 video models downscale it anyway; upscale the rendered *video* instead.\n\n## Two 1-Click Switches\n1. **`USE UPSCALE MODEL?`**\n   - **ON (default):** Uses `UpscaleModelLoader` + `ImageUpscaleWithModel` (best sharpness/detail; drop e.g. `4x-UltraSharp.pth` or `RealESRGAN_x4plus.pth` into `ComfyUI/models/upscale_models/`).\n   - **OFF (No Model):** Fast `lanczos` resize directly to `Target WIDTH \u00d7 Target HEIGHT` \u2014 **if you have no files in `models/upscale_models/`, press Ctrl+B on `UpscaleModelLoader` and `ImageUpscaleWithModel` so ComfyUI skips validating the loader.**\n2. **`FIT TO TARGET SIZE?`**\n   - **ON (default):** Cleanly resizes the model output down (`area`) to exact `1920\u00d71088` (supersampled 1080p, \u00f732 video-ready).\n   - **OFF:** Outputs the full raw model upscale size (e.g., 4\u00d7).\n"
      },
      "title": "HOW TO: Final Image Upscale (Model vs No-Model If/Else)",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
